<title>AUSTRALIA: Wesfarmers half-yr profit soars.</title>
<headline>Wesfarmers half-yr profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     90.3 vs 61.1</p>
<p>    Net				     57.55 vs 38.25</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	   20.0 vs 17.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Wesfarmers Ltd is a West Australian based agricultural, energy and hardware group and is about 51 percent owned by The Franked Income fund.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.19 vs 1.14</p>
<p>    Other income			  72.66 vs 34.34</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    25.0 vs 17.2</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 21</p>
<p>Reg date March 27</p>
<p>    Tax				     32.61 vs 22.47</p>
<p>    Interest				14.43 vs 17.21</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  49.04 vs 44.58</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
